"cells":[["+40%"]]}]}],"sections":[{"id":"unlocking","title":"Unlocking","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["In order to unlock Sara, the player must evolve the ",{"i":"Sprite-Alchemy_Whip.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:alchemy-whip"}," ",{"t":"Alchemy Whip","r":"weapon:alchemy-whip"}," after obtainining the ",{"i":"Sprite-Black_Disk.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"relic:black-disk"}," ",{"t":"Black Disk","r":"relic:black-disk"},". She is then made available for purchase for ",{"i":"Sprite-Gold_Coin.png","w":10,"h":10}," 1,665, scaling with other characters purchased."]},{"k":"p","c":["Alternatively, Sara can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"bondedsoul\"."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"passive-bonuses","title":"Passive bonuses","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["Sara starts with +20% ",{"i":"Sprite-Move_Speed.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:move-speed"}," ",{"t":"Move Speed","r":"powerup:move-speed"},", and +40% ",{"i":"Sprite-Duration.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:duration"}," ",{"t":"Duration","r":"powerup:duration"},". She gains +0.02 ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"}," every level. There is no cap on this bonus."]},{"k":"p","c":["Once per life, when she takes fatal damage, she triggers a ",{"i":"Sprite-Nduja_Fritta_Tanto.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:nduja-fritta-tanto"}," ",{"t":"Nduja Fritta Tanto","r":"weapon:nduja-fritta-tanto"}," for all players in the game. Notably it doesn't prevent her from dying, but if she revives, she will have the firebreathing effect still active."]},{"k":"p","c":["When she revives, she evolves the Alchemy Whip into the ",{"i":"Sprite-Vampire_Killer.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:vampire-killer"}," ",{"t":"Vampire Killer","r":"weapon:vampire-killer"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"},". The evolution will occur regardless of the whip's level and the ",{"i":"Sprite-Tirajisú.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"passive:tirajisu"}," ",{"t":"Tirajisú","r":"passive:tirajisu"}," is not required."]},{"k":"p","c":["Sara can find special Ode to Castlevania pickups from light sources."]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"gallery","title":"Gallery","blocks":[{"k":"gallery","items":[{"i":"Sprite-Sara_Trantoul.png","w":99,"h":120,"c":["Sara Trantoul's sprite"]},{"i":"Animated-Sara_Trantoul.gif","w":99,"h":120,"c":["Movement animation"]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 31 October 2024 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Her unlocking spell and her ability to evolve the Alchemy Whip after dying are references to Lament of Innocence where her dying, and being sacrificed, allows the Alchemy Whip to be transformed into the Vampire Killer."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Her soul, however, isn't actually bonded to the whip."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"external-links","title":"External links","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"t":"Sara Trantoul","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Sara_Trantoul"}," on the ",{"t":" Castlevania Wiki","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/"}]}]}],"subs":[]}]}